---
title: "Train coming"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> open
  open: 0 s road open
  warning: 2 s train detected, lights and bell
  lowering: 11 s barrier coming down
  down: 14 s barrier down
  train: 20 s train on the crossing
  clear: 26 s train gone
  raising: 31 s barrier going up
  open --> warning: train detected
  warning --> warning: wait 6 s [not flashed]
  warning --> lowering: lower barrier [lights flashed]
  lowering --> down: barrier down
  down --> down: another train [no second train yet]
  down --> train: train arrives
  train --> train: another train [no second train yet]
  train --> clear: train leaves
  clear --> train: train arrives [train due]
  clear --> raising: raise barrier [crossing clear]
  raising --> open: barrier up
